---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Disclaimer from '../components/Disclaimer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Fees — none at the paper stage | SPA earn-defi.com"
  description="No fees: this is a paper stage and nothing is offered. Commercial terms only after a separate go-live decision and a legal review."
  canonical="https://earn-defi.com/fees"
>

  <!-- Owner decision 2026-10-03 (package three-portfolios-closeout, item 4): ONE text on the three
       strategy pages and here. The illustrative future fee model (management fee, high-water mark,
       no lock-up, worked example) that stood here since 28c6cb594 (2026-06-21) is removed on purpose:
       no future fee model is to be published now. -->
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="pt-20 pb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4 leading-tight" data-ru="Комиссии">
        Fees
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/60 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" data-ru="Комиссий нет: это бумажная стадия, ничего не предлагается. Коммерческие условия — только после go-live и юридической проверки.">
        No fees: this is a paper stage and nothing is offered. Commercial terms only after go-live and a legal review.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Paper stage -->
    <section class="py-10 border-t border-border">
      <p class="text-xs text-white/50 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-4" data-ru="Бумажная стадия">Paper stage</p>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-warn-border bg-warn-bg p-5 flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-warn flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">&#9888;</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-2" data-ru="Три портфеля ведутся на бумаге. Реальный капитал не принимается и не управляется, поэтому комиссии не начисляются.">
            The three portfolios run on paper. No real capital is accepted or managed, so no fees accrue.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/35" data-ru="Любые будущие коммерческие условия возможны только после отдельного решения о go-live и юридической проверки. Сейчас никакая модель комиссий не установлена и не публикуется.">
            Any future commercial terms are possible only after a separate go-live decision and a legal review. No fee model is set or published now.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Continue links -->
    <section class="pb-16 border-t border-border pt-10">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-sm text-white/50 mb-6" data-ru="Продолжить чтение">Continue reading</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/methodology" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-border-strong text-white/50 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 text-sm transition-all" data-ru="Методология">
            Methodology
          </a>
          <a href="/risk-disclosure" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-border-strong text-white/50 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 text-sm transition-all" data-ru="Раскрытие рисков">
            Risk Disclosure
          </a>
          <a href="/dashboard" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-border-strong text-white/50 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 text-sm transition-all" data-ru="Дашборд">
            Dashboard
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Disclaimer />
</Layout>
